A10 iOS port: third-party notices and attributions
==================================================

This repository ports iOS 16 (XNU-8796 and the iPhone X 20H392 user space)
to the Samsung Galaxy A10 (SM-A105F, Exynos 7884B).  It is an experimental
project, not a product.  The code is distributed under the licences below;
each imported project keeps its own copyright and licence text.

