4. Open Mapple
--------------
https://github.com/open-mapple
The Open Mapple kernel common (xnu_kernel_mediatek_common) is Apple's XNU
with the ios-sweet and ios-viva patch series.  Apple's files and changes to
them are APSL 2.0; files added by ios-sweet/ios-viva are MIT, Copyright (c)
2026 dipa-studio.  Its memory-hole model (mp_mem4g), framebuffer design and
other kernel changes are used as a reference; where code is adapted, the
adapted file keeps this notice and the original copyright.

The Open Mapple manifest is MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 the Open Mapple authors.

The Open Mapple GPU (mapple_gpu_mali) is GPL-3.0-or-later with the section
7(b) attribution term described in section 3 above.  Mesa and its patches,
the libdrm headers and the tables from Arm's Valhall ISA description keep
their MIT licences.  The Mapple application and the release assembler are
proprietary and are not used here.

